nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面在GTC2026发布并开源三大Transformer基础组件替代方案</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布AI时代记分卡，引入“有用智能每美元”衡量ROI</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind发布GenCeption模型，利用视频生成技术实现多项视觉任务突破</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">马斯克称xAI旗下2万亿参数大模型即将完成训练，或挑战Kimi K3性能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f522f27f968293bce5fa641ed861e48a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">特斯拉CEO马斯克近日透露，其旗下xAI研发的2万亿参数大模型预计将于下周完成初步训练。该模型性能将显著超越此前1.5万亿参数版本，并被视为对月之暗面近期发布的Kimi K3大模型的有力挑战。Kimi K3作为目前全球参数规模最大的开源大模型之一，拥有2.8万亿参数、100万词元上下文窗口及原生视觉理解能力，此前在Arena AI前端编程排行榜以1679分位居全球第一。马斯克曾公开评价Kimi K3表现令人印象深刻。此次xAI新模型训练进展的披露，标志着全球AI厂商在超大规模模型领域的竞争进一步加剧，参数规模、推理能力及开源生态已成为技术角逐的核心焦点。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里发布Token Plan个人版并上线Qwen3.8-Max-Preview模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ceebdfcbec3ff731e17fdaba0c48808e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里正式发布Token Plan个人版，并同步开放Qwen3.8-Max-Preview模型体验。该模型参数规模达2.4万亿，在代码工程与专业办公场景表现优异，正式版预计近期开源。Token Plan个人版提供Lite、Standard、Pro三档套餐，售价分别为39元、139元及499元/月；团队版席位价格为150元至1398元/月不等。阿里推出限时优惠，白天Credits消耗降至1折，个人版用户夜间使用可享折上折。此外，AI编程产品Qoder与QoderWork已首发支持该模型，千问PC端用户可免费体验。此次发布通过Token Plan与开发工具联动，旨在降低大模型使用门槛，加速Qwen系列在生产力场景的落地与生态建设。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面在GTC2026发布并开源三大Transformer基础组件替代方案</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/771388504ca418bb53c19b1e1546d63c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在GTC2026演讲中，月之暗面CEO杨植麟宣布对Transformer架构的三大核心组件进行重构，并全面开源相关技术。针对数据效率瓶颈，月之暗面推出MuonClip优化器替代Adam，通过独立参数更新提升训练效率；针对长上下文计算成本，发布Kimi Linear架构，利用KDA（Kimi Delta Attention）线性注意力机制实现长短信息的高效处理；针对深层网络信息传递，提出Attention Residue（注意力残差）技术，允许模型主动从历史计算中挑选信息。此外，杨植麟还介绍了支持多Agent协作的Agent Swarm框架及视觉文本早期融合训练方案。这些技术旨在通过优化底层架构，在数据与算力受限背景下提升模型性能。月之暗面强调，开源模型不仅要开放，更需通过底层创新实现性能突破，上述组件均已开源，</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布AI时代记分卡，引入“有用智能每美元”衡量ROI</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/34e91b0e607a318a17e195c23e79f215.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于7月17日发布AI时代记分卡，提出“有用智能每美元”指标，旨在帮助企业评估AI投入的真实投资回报率。该指标超越了传统的Token成本计算，核心在于衡量模型完成实际任务的综合价值。OpenAI指出，企业应关注任务成功率、人工审核成本及模型推理效率。随文发布的GPT-5.6模型系列包含Sol、Terra、Luna三个层级，其中GPT-5.6 Sol在DeepSWE v1.1工程任务中表现优异，API成本预估降低36.2%。OpenAI强调，通过提升模型推理效率与可靠性，企业可实现单位成本下有用智能产出的持续增长。此举旨在引导行业从关注Token消耗转向关注AI在实际工作流中的产出价值，通过ChatGPT Work等产品，帮助企业在保障安全与合规的前提下，将AI深度集成至业务流程中，从而实现算力投入与业</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind发布GenCeption模型，利用视频生成技术实现多项视觉任务突破</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9b0d5d43ad449628a8487ebcac6773d3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind发布基于视频生成模型构建的GenCeption，旨在解决深度估计、图像分割及3D姿态估计等计算机视觉任务。该模型基于阿里巴巴开源的Wan2.1视频模型开发，通过简化架构实现一次前向传播即可完成多项视觉预测。在训练数据方面，GenCeption仅使用包含7500个视频的合成数据集，数据需求量较传统专用模型降低至七分之一至五百分之一。测试显示，该模型在深度估计、表面法线预测及语言引导分割等任务中表现优异，并具备处理真实世界多人场景、动物及人形机器人的泛化能力。目前，模型处理81帧视频的推理耗时约为6至10秒。研究团队指出，GenCeption证明了视频生成模型具备向通用视觉基础模型拓展的潜力，但联合训练多任务对复杂任务性能的影响及推理速度优化仍是后续挑战。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
